{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36914","headline":"息夫人庙 · 罗隐","name":"息夫人庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百雉摧残连野青，庙门犹见昔朝廷。\n一生虽抱楚王恨，千载终爲息地灵。\n虫网翠环终缥缈，风吹宝瑟助微冥。\n玉颜浑似羞来客，依旧无言照画屏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}